# Footer version (InvoicePay)

Every shippable build must show the current software version as **plain searchable text in the footer only**:

1. **`php/index.php`** — comment line `InvoicePay vX.Y.Z` (source text search; not rendered)
2. **Landing `/`** — footer `InvoicePay vX.Y.Z`
3. **App shell `/app`** — bottom bar `InvoicePay vX.Y.Z`
4. Keep `VERSION`, `php/VERSION`, and `Http::VERSION` in lockstep

Do **not** put the version in `<title>` or in any heading. Search results should stay readable.

Never rely only on a buried sidebar label or a CSS `?v=` query string.
